WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Maria Chen: Each of the four employee resource groups submitted their budget requests for next year.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Alicia Gomez: The mentorship-focused group is requesting additional funding for an external speaker series.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Maria Chen: Let's compare that against last year's attendance numbers before approving the increase.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Alicia Gomez: I'll pull attendance data and bring a recommendation to the next budget review.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Maria Chen: We also need an executive sponsor confirmed for the newest group before funding is released.
